WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.257 --> 00:00:10.052
Here exists a single tablet.

00:00:11.178 --> 00:00:14.306
Beings 
of an ancient civilization,

00:00:14.389 --> 00:00:16.558
whose great advances
resulted in their downfall,

00:00:17.059 --> 00:00:19.728
relayed a warning
to the present generation

00:00:19.811 --> 00:00:21.146
through this notice.

00:00:22.481 --> 00:00:23.607
They wrote,

00:00:24.399 --> 00:00:27.361
"Protect our legacy&nbsp;
from evildoers."

00:00:28.654 --> 00:00:31.073
An organization sincerely
accepted this message

00:00:31.156 --> 00:00:35.369
and actively seeks to keep
the ancient civilization sealed.

00:00:35.953 --> 00:00:38.872
And the special agents
of that organization...

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:42.000
are called "Spriggan."

